                     "innolitics-rdm:README.md@f21b508"]}
 "UN-002" {:text "A contributor is stopped before a spec that breaks its rules is committed, and told exactly which scenario and why."
           :sources ["rdm:dhf/AGENT_WORKFLOW.md@3763e08"
                     "innolitics-rdm:rdm/hooks.py@f21b508"]}
 "UN-003" {:text "A team sees each scenario's verification status, derived from executed test results, whatever stack ran the tests."
           :sources ["rdm:docs/reference/cli.md@3763e08"
                     "innolitics-rdm:README.md@f21b508"]}
 "UN-004" {:text "A release is blocked until every scenario is verified and none is still planned."
           :sources ["rdm:dhf/documents/verification_and_validation_plan.md@3763e08"]}
 "UN-005" {:text "A team keeps its architecture as one C4 model whose views are generated and checked, and whose components own the scenarios."
           :sources ["rdm:dhf/documents/verification_and_validation_plan.md@3763e08"]}
 "UN-006" {:text "A team regenerates its implementation from a merged cut of the spec, in a clean room that provably holds no earlier implementation or measurement."
